{"unit_id":"maxiaovivi__dsh-cloak-browser#card-zh","repo":"maxiaovivi/dsh-cloak-browser","commit":"d652020cebd601d24c1ed39fc00175558cfc166c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cloak-browser 是面向 DSH 的原生浏览器工具插件，为每个 Agent 管理独立的 CloakBrowser 会话。它通过 DSH tools 注册浏览器操作，并在打开网页、导航和交互后返回有界页面快照及可复用的元素引用。用户可以点击、填写、选择、等待和切换标签页，也能提取网页文本或 HTML、查看属性并保存截图。它适合需要操作 JavaScript 网页、检查渲染状态或完成表单流程的 DSH 用户。运行需要 Node.js 20 及兼容平台；许可密钥和代理环境变量均可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.mjs:512-529","lib/plugin.mjs:533-562","lib/plugin.mjs:675-775","cordis.patch.yml:8-12"]}
{"unit_id":"maxiaovivi__dsh-cloak-browser#card-en","repo":"maxiaovivi/dsh-cloak-browser","commit":"d652020cebd601d24c1ed39fc00175558cfc166c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cloak-browser gives each DSH agent an isolated browser session. It returns page snapshots and element refs for navigation and interaction. Agents can fill forms, extract content, manage tabs, and capture screenshots. Requires Node.js 20; license and proxy settings are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.mjs:512-529","lib/plugin.mjs:533-562","lib/plugin.mjs:675-775","cordis.patch.yml:8-12"]}
